# FinanceGuard — Environment Variables
#
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in your values.
# .env.local is git-ignored and will NOT be committed.
#
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# AI COPILOT — OpenAI API Key
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Optional. When provided, the Copilot uses GPT-4o-mini to generate
# AI-powered financial insights. When absent or left as placeholder,
# the Copilot automatically falls back to the deterministic financial
# engine (fully functional offline — no key required for the demo).
#
# 1. Sign up at https://platform.openai.com
# 2. Create an API key at https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
# 3. Paste it below:

OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...your-key-here...
